{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (CAREGIVER): Eish, the parking was hectic. We came in the bakkie.",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (DOCTOR): Sore heel?",
  "[SEG0003] person_3 (PATIENT): Heel.",
  "[SEG0004] person_2 (DOCTOR): Right or left?",
  "[SEG0005] person_3 (PATIENT): Right.",
  "[SEG0006] person_2 (DOCTOR): How long?",
  "[SEG0007] person_3 (PATIENT): Two months.",
  "[SEG0008] person_1 (CAREGIVER): Umm, it's the right heel, two months, sore on the first steps in the morning. Eases once he walks a bit. Comes back if he sits.",
  "[SEG0009] person_3 (PATIENT): Ja.",
  "[SEG0010] person_2 (DOCTOR): Feels like what?",
  "[SEG0011] person_3 (PATIENT): Like I've overdone it.",
  "[SEG0012] person_2 (DOCTOR): Running?",
  "[SEG0013] person_3 (PATIENT): Ja.",
  "[SEG0014] person_2 (DOCTOR): How far?",
  "[SEG0015] person_3 (PATIENT): Five k. Evenings.",
  "[SEG0016] person_1 (CAREGIVER): And he works the till at Checkers, full shift, hard floor.",
  "[SEG0017] person_2 (DOCTOR): New shoes?",
  "[SEG0018] person_1 (CAREGIVER): Ja, new takkies, umm, last week, no, about a month back. Green ones from the China mall. After the heel started. Did nothing.",
  "[SEG0019] person_3 (PATIENT): Nothing.",
  "[SEG0020] person_2 (DOCTOR): Swelling?",
  "[SEG0021] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0022] person_2 (DOCTOR): Red?",
  "[SEG0023] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0024] person_2 (DOCTOR): Knee pain or back pain?",
  "[SEG0025] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0026] person_2 (DOCTOR): Feet go numb?",
  "[SEG0027] person_3 (PATIENT): Feet feel dead.",
  "[SEG0028] person_2 (DOCTOR): Feet stiff in the mornings too?",
  "[SEG0029] person_3 (PATIENT): Ja.",
  "[SEG0030] person_2 (DOCTOR): Noisy at Checkers?",
  "[SEG0031] person_3 (PATIENT): Can't hear myself think.",
  "[SEG0032] person_1 (CAREGIVER): Oh, his sister takes metforman for her sugar. She WhatsApps him all the time. Her tablets, not his.",
  "[SEG0033] person_2 (DOCTOR): You diabetic?",
  "[SEG0034] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0035] person_2 (DOCTOR): Tablets of your own?",
  "[SEG0036] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0037] person_2 (DOCTOR): Allergies?",
  "[SEG0038] person_3 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0039] person_2 (DOCTOR): I'll press.",
  "[SEG0040] person_2 (DOCTOR): Tender over the medial heel. No swelling to see. Achilles not tender.",
  "[SEG0041] person_2 (DOCTOR): Likely the plantar fascia. A spur could sit there too, I can't separate them in the room, and I won't conclude more than that. Not a stress fracture, and I'm not calling a neuropathy off the dead feet. No x-ray.",
  "[SEG0042] person_2 (DOCTOR): Calf stretches before you stand. Proper arch insoles from the chemist. Leave the running for now. Come back if it's not better in six weeks.",
  "[SEG0043] person_3 (PATIENT): Sharp."
 ],
